"清空当前保存的 Notion Token 与数据库配置，完成后返回欢迎页。不会清除本地缓存的任务和日记内容。" = "Clear the saved Notion token and database configuration, then return to the welcome screen. Local cached tasks and journal entries are kept.";
"这会清空当前配置，不会清除本地缓存的任务和日记内容，完成后返回欢迎页。" = "This clears the current configuration but keeps local cached tasks and journal entries, then returns to the welcome screen.";
"1. 打开 Notion 的 My integrations，创建一个 Internal Integration。" = "1. Open Notion My integrations and create an Internal Integration.";
"2. 在该 integration 的 Configuration 页面复制 Installation access token。" = "2. Copy the Installation access token from that integration’s Configuration page.";
"3. 打开 Tasks 和 Journal 数据库右上角菜单，把这个 integration 添加到 Connections。" = "3. Open the top-right menu of the Tasks and Journal databases, then add this integration under Connections.";
"4. 回到这里粘贴 token，并把两个数据库的完整 URL 粘贴到对应输入框。" = "4. Paste the token here, then paste each database’s full URL into its corresponding field.";
"打开 Notion integrations" = "Open Notion integrations";
"1. 在 Notion 中打开你的 Tasks Database，确保进入的是这个任务数据库本身，而不是某个单独页面。" = "1. Open your Tasks Database in Notion and make sure you are on the database itself, not an individual page.";
"2. 如果当前看到的是嵌入在页面里的数据库视图，先点击数据库标题或“Open as full page”，切到数据库完整页面。" = "2. If it is an embedded database view, select the database title or “Open as full page” to open the full database.";
"3. 这个任务数据库至少需要这些字段类型：1 个 title、1 个 date、1 个 checkbox。字段名可以自定义，但每种必填类型只能有 1 个，否则应用无法判断该用哪个字段。" = "3. The Tasks Database needs one title, one date, and one checkbox property. Names may be customized, but there must be exactly one of each required type.";
"4. 如果你还希望在应用里使用预计时长，可以额外准备 number 字段；只有当任务数据库里恰好只有 1 个 number 字段时，应用才会自动把它当作预计时长。" = "4. To use estimated time, add a number property. The app uses it only when the Tasks Database has exactly one number property.";
"5. 在右上角点击“分享”或页面菜单，选择“复制链接”。也可以直接复制浏览器地址栏中的完整链接。" = "5. Use Share or the page menu in the upper-right corner and choose Copy link. You can also copy the full browser URL.";
"6. 把完整链接粘贴到 Tasks Database ID 输入框，应用会自动提取其中的数据库 ID。" = "6. Paste the full link into Tasks Database ID; the app extracts the database ID automatically.";
"1. 在 Notion 中打开你的 Journal Database，确认这是用于保存日记条目的数据库。" = "1. Open your Journal Database in Notion and confirm it stores journal entries.";
"2. 如果你现在看到的是某个日记页面里的 linked database，先打开数据库原始页面，避免复制错普通页面链接。" = "2. If you see a linked database inside a journal page, open the original database first to avoid copying a page link.";
"3. 这个日记数据库至少需要这些字段类型：1 个 title、1 个 date。字段名可以自定义，但每种必填类型只能有 1 个，否则应用无法判断该用哪个字段。" = "3. The Journal Database needs one title and one date property. Names may be customized, but there must be exactly one of each required type.";
"4. 日记正文会自动保存到对应日记页面中，不需要额外创建文本字段。" = "4. Journal text is saved in the corresponding Notion page; no extra text property is needed.";
"5. 日记推荐使用画廊视图展示，便于浏览和回顾。" = "5. A gallery view is recommended for easier browsing and review.";
"6. 通过右上角“分享”里的“复制链接”，或直接复制地址栏中的完整链接，拿到 Journal Database 的 URL。" = "6. Use Copy link in Share, or copy the full browser URL, to get the Journal Database URL.";
"7. 把这个完整链接粘贴到 Journal Database ID 输入框，应用会自动解析并填入正确的数据库 ID。" = "7. Paste the full link into Journal Database ID; the app extracts and fills the correct database ID.";
